00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.910 align:start position:0%
 
the protagonist of the film is a  mexican-american young man named jp one  day at a house party jp and his family  are engaging in cheerful conversations  his sister lily is busy making fortune  origami and passing it to everyone  suddenly the immigration police barge  into the house and restrain the entire  family jp and lily try to reach out to  each other when the screen goes blank  the following day all immigrant families  in america including jps go into a  frenzy because of the new law  implemented by governor finn harper a no  tolerance policy has been issued against  every single illegal immigrant and their  children even those who are born and  raised in america the illegal immigrants  will be imprisoned while their children  will be deported back to their own  countries until the next action is taken  they will be separated into groups and  kept in camps jp is separated from his  family and sent to live in an open space  with a bunch of strangers after two days  of living in the camp he finally sees  lily outside he tries to call her but  she is taken away on a bus meanwhile  several protests against the governor  are being organized by the supporters of  the democratic party a bill is proposed  to revert the latest law but it is  dismissed by parliament on the fourth  day jp and a select few are taken to an  immigration officer she suggests several  ways they can get their family back but  most of them include spending a lot of  money or hiring a lawyer the easiest way  out would be to take part in a community  service program the people who apply  will be taken to an old age home where  they will have to take care of the old  and sick retirees if they complete the  terms of service their families will be  let free and they can go back to their  normal lives the program is sketchy  starting the first step because only a  select few youngsters are provided the  opportunity but the desperate children  wanting to free their parents do not  think for a second before accepting to  go during the selection process jp makes  friends with a bunch of people first is  a black hispanic guy named big mac he is  a womanizer and doesn't really care  about the program second is camilla a  democrat protester then there is a  paranoid guy named chris who thinks they  will be drugged and killed in the  program and lastly they are joined by an  argentinian mysterious girl micah at the  old age home they meet the founder eric  dane he welcomes everyone in and thanks  them for being active youths in society  he gives them a brief speech about the  program being a learning experience for  many children they are then handed over  to the security officers cynthia and  james during their stay at the  establishment the officers will be their  babysitters they will decide who gets to  leave first and who doesn't the  participants are made to wear a tracker  on their feet that will locate them at  all times the process is again very  suspicious but the newbies do not think  much of it after that they are given a  tour of the place while walking through  the garden jp locks eyes with an older  woman named greta she looks at him  strangely without breaking eye contact  then they are brought to the lounge area  and left to entertain the guests they  can either talk to them read books to  them play chess and so on their main aim  is to make sure the guests do not wander  away because all of them have dementia  during the lunch break jp and his group  sit together to eat the taste of the  meatloaf is disgusting which breaks  their spirit even more since they have  to eat it for the time they work there  chris refuses to eat or drink anything  claiming that the government has mixed  something with their food he only uses  his inhaler throughout the meal while  the others eat then finally they get to  meet and socialize with the old people  everyone picks a guest while jp searches  the room for greta and then approaches  her she doesn't say anything and only  keeps staring at him jp takes this as a  hint and starts reading a book suddenly  greta loses control of her emotions and  tells jp that he will die here when she  doesn't show signs of stopping cynthia  sedates her and brings her away from the  rest jp is left shocked and guilty  assuming that he was the cause of the  breakdown an entire day passes in the  facility but chris still refuses to eat  the lack of nutrition causes him to turn  more paranoid than he already is he  thinks the window on the back of the  dining hall is one-sided and someone is  keeping an eye on them from the other  side the rest of the group doesn't  believe him so to prove himself he tries  to open the door as a result he is  sedated and dragged away to the  infirmary later that night jp wakes up  and goes to the toilet on his way he  comes across an owl that flies away on  seeing him seconds later he hears a  noise coming from the dark and sees a  naked old woman staring right at him she  yells virgil will set you free and  attacks jp he freezes in shock until the  security arrives and brings the woman  away they claim that she just ran away  from her room but jp can tell something  is seriously wrong with her the  following day work starts early the  security officer james calls jp racist  slurs which causes a slight argument  between the two as they are taking care  of an old man jp is attacked again he  falls unconscious and wakes up in the  afternoon to his surprise lily is also  in the room she reveals that she had  been with him all along and asks him to  just look harder suddenly jp wakes up  realizing that it was only a dream  however lily's comment stays in his head  for the entire day meanwhile chris has  still not returned since he was sedated  the last time when cynthia is asked she  reveals that he was sent back to the  detention center for not being obedient  after she leaves big mac bluntly claims  that she is lying he found chris's  inhaler in the hallways an hour ago  which means he is still in the facility  it is clear that the workers are hiding  something from them when it gets dark  big mac brings greta to her friend  phillips room he believes that spending  time together will be a good bonding  experience for two old people however as  he is setting up the tv something  happens to philip his bones start  cracking and he falls off the bed in  only seconds philip goes completely out  of control and acts like he is being  possessed his body folds into an  inverted position and he eventually dies  big mac is traumatized by what he had to  see but the cause of the death is  declared heart failure  that day eddie calls james and jp into  the front yard and introduces them to  his pet owl virgil this reminds jp of  the first night he was attacked but he  doesn't think much of it eddie believes  that jp can be a permanent employee  like james and wants him to stay close  although jp is not willing to be here  permanently he pretends to be interested  in front of eddie before leaving eddie  asks them to hog because he knows they  are not on good terms jp takes this  chance to steal the key to the tracker  on his feet he uses the key to unlock  the tracker at night at first he goes to  mac's room and finds him enjoying a  self-care day with face masks and music  mac refuses to come outside so jp moves  on to camilla's room she also unlocks  her tracker and goes to enjoy the night  of freedom on her own at last jp is left  with micah they steal alcohol and enjoy  it inside the pool jp is clearly  interested in micah and she takes the  hint they flirt for about an hour before  kissing and moving into her bedroom the  following morning jp wakes up to an old  lady beside him in the bed he freaks out  but is soon told that she climbed in the  bed randomly because of dementia later  jp is telling mac about last night but  halfway through the story discovers that  he doesn't remember what happened when  he got into bed as he is trying to  recall the incidents he sees greta  playing with a fortune-telling origami  this reminds him of his sister who used  to frequently make the same thing for  her cousins jp asks the lady if someone  gave it to her but gets no answer in  return suddenly she holds his hands and  starts shivering before the guards come  to his aid and sedate her jp and the  rest of the group are talking about the  incident when camilla reveals that she  doesn't remember anything from last  night as if she blacked out they also  discover a mark on her neck and  theorized that she was sedated when it  gets dark jp decides to search the  facility at first he goes to the  infirmary where only the security guards  are allowed to go he approaches greta  and sees a butterfly tattoo behind her  ears the tattoo is identical to the one  jp saw on his sister on the night their  house was raided it is now clear to him  that the old lady he was taken care of  is none other than his sister however  before he can take any action james  finds him and knocks him out the  following day the rest of the group is  suspicious of jp's disappearance they  decide to snoop around eddie's office to  see if they can find something micah and  mac go inside while camilla stays  outside to keep an eye on james after  searching around for a while mac finds  the blueprint of some sort of grinding  machine they are almost caught when  james comes into the room but he fails  to see them hiding in the corner  somewhere else jp wakes up in a  wheelchair beside two people his age but  when they turn around he is left  speechless one half of their face is old  and wrinkly while the other half is  young jp shortly finds out the same  thing has happened to him as well some  time later he is left alone in the room  but to escape he has to punch in a  password after giving it some thought jp  types virgil and unlocks the door i'm  kind of disappointed he didn't try  password 69 420 first at the same time  governor finn and eddie are at an outlet  of the chain restaurant liberty burgers  they co-own the entire chain and are  delighted by the profit they're making  recently amidst the conversation finn  inquires if anyone has made a complaint  about the burger patties in the past  month eddie confidently says that it is  impossible because he has found the  perfect alternative for ham i don't like  where this is going back at the facility  jp enters the production room and is in  utter shock to find dead bodies in  ziploc bags it is revealed that eddie  uses human meat and bones to create the  patties of the burger because real meat  is too expensive they use the bodies of  refugee immigrant youngsters to make  commercial meat the illegal immigrants  are given different hormones to  tenderize human meat and as a side  effect people turn old this gave the  business a perfect cover for what they  are actually doing down here jp freaks  out and bumps into micah while trying to  run away another shock hits him when  micah reveals that she was planted by  eddie to keep an eye on everyone from  the inside somewhere else mack enters  the vent to hide from the maniacs he has  also found out that they are being  drugged every day a while later he  reaches on top of camilla's room through  the vent and gives her a key to unlock  her tracker they go their separate ways  to help jp from different sides camilla  goes to the dining hall and finds out  that chris was right about the one-way  window chris was right about goddamn  everything however before she can tell  the others she is knocked out upon  waking up half of her face has also aged  jp is by her side telling her that they  don't have much time although they are  weak they decide to plan an attack at  night at first everyone including the  old people make sure that cynthia micah  and james are the only ones in the room  then they surround the three and proceed  to attack them jp tries to run outside  but while struggling against a guard his  urine bag is snatched away he endures  the pain and continues fighting  eventually mack and the rest of the old  people run outside while jp camilla and  lily end up in the production room there  they find chris who is still alive  suddenly eddie makes an attack blaming  jp for ruining everything since jp is  weak he is easily overpowered and put on  the platform to be turned into ground  mead but at the last second camilla  saves him after that chris's bones start  crackling he grows aggressive and  unstoppable because of the hormones in  an instant he snaps eddie's neck and  kills him as jp and the group walk away  eddie is ground into thin meat in the  last scene it is reported that finn has  fled the country and the entire burger  chain has been stopped jp's mother is  let free alongside all other immigrant  parents who finally get to see their  kids subscribe for more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching

